sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant A as Arduino door unit
    participant PC as PC door program
    participant FS as FaceStore (local disk)
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Note over PC,DB: Every 2 minutes and at 12:00 / 16:00
    PC->>+API: GET /api/devices/{id}/session
    API->>DB: seats, already inside, session end
    API-->>-PC: students[], alreadyInside[], endsAt
    Note over S,DB: A student walks up
    S->>A: stands 25-50 cm for 1 s
    activate A
    A->>PC: READY
    activate PC
    PC->>PC: detect face (YuNet), embed (SFace)
    PC->>FS: best_match(embedding)
    FS-->>PC: (studentId, similarity)
    alt similarity < 0.40
        PC->>A: D
        A-->>S: ACCESS DENIED (low tone)
    else already inside this session
        PC->>A: A
        A-->>S: ALREADY INSIDE (two beeps)
    else session ended
        PC->>A: D
        A-->>S: ACCESS DENIED (low tone)
    else recognised
        PC->>A: G
        A-->>S: ACCESS GRANTED (two rising tones)
        Note right of PC: PC window shows seat N + module,<br/>or "no exam seat in this session"
    end
    deactivate A
    PC-)API: POST /api/access-events<br/>deviceId, decision, studentId, clientEventId
    activate API
    API->>DB: INSERT access_events (duplicate clientEventId ignored)
    API-->>PC: 201 Created (or 200 duplicate)
    deactivate API
    deactivate PC
    opt internet down
        PC->>PC: keep events in data/event_queue.json
        PC-)API: later: POST /api/access-events/batch (max 100)
    end
